# 全擋再白名單：只有明列的工作流資產入版控，
# runtime 產物（sessions/cache/憑證/transcripts）一律不進
*
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json
!statusline.sh
!skills/
!skills/**
!agents/
!agents/**
!hooks/
!hooks/**
# memory 要備份，但它上層的 projects/ 是 transcripts，只放行 memory
!projects/
projects/*
!projects/-Users-mike/
projects/-Users-mike/*
!projects/-Users-mike/memory/
!projects/-Users-mike/memory/**
# 放在最後才能蓋過上面的白名單
.DS_Store
